WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.660
What is 2⁵ ÷ 2²?

00:00:03.660 --> 00:00:06.390
5 twos on top, 2 on the bottom.

00:00:06.390 --> 00:00:07.860
2 pairs cancel.

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.400
3 twos left.

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:10.690
2³

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:14.016
Dividing means you subtract the powers.
